# Copy this file to ".env" and add your Anthropic API key.
# Expo inlines EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars into the client bundle on all platforms.
# Without a key, the app falls back to a basic offline story engine.
#
# NOTE: a client-side key is visible to the client. Fine for a prototype; for
# production, point ClaudeStoryEngine at your own backend proxy instead.
EXPO_PUBLIC_ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
